[Proposition 22 of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] For all $k\in \Nbb_{\leq n}$ and $f:\cube^n\to \Rbb$,
\begin{equation}
    \Wop^{\geq k}(f) \leq \sum_{J\subseteq [n]:|J|=k} \Vop_J(f) \leq \Vop^k(f) \leq \left\|\left|\grad^k f\right|\right\|_{\Leb^2}^2.
\end{equation}

