body:
[Theorem tflbadm of arXiv:2411.09005, 'On Time-Changed Linear Birth-Death Process with Immigration at Extinction'] For $t\ge0$, the series components of the state probabilities of TFLBPwI are given by
	\begin{equation}
		\bar{p}_k^\nu(n,t)=\begin{cases}
			\frac{(-\alpha t^\nu)^k}{\Gamma(k\nu+1)},\ n=0,\ k\ge0,\vspace{0.1cm}\\
			\sum_{r=1}^{n}(-1)^{r+k}\binom{n-1}{r-1}\frac{\alpha((r\lambda)^{k}-\alpha^{k})t^{k\nu}}{(r\lambda-\alpha)\Gamma(k\nu+1)},\ n\ge1,\ k\ge n,\vspace{0.1cm}\\
			0,\ n-k\ge1.
		\end{cases}
	\end{equation}

