[Lemma eq:even-product of arXiv:2607.14087, 'Stochastic Domination of Gaussian Maxima: A Resolution of the Weak Simplex Conjecture'] \label[lemma]{lem:even-factors}
Under the hypotheses of (lem:rectangles of the paper), let
$g_1,\ldots,g_m:\mathbb R\to[0,\infty)$ be bounded, even, and log-concave.  Then
\begin{equation}
  \mathbb E\prod_{i=1}^m g_i(V_i)
  \geq\prod_{i=1}^m\int g_i\,d\gamma_1.
\end{equation}

