[Lemma 16 (Lemma 3.6 of \cite{Chen2024} at $n=7$) of arXiv:2608.26598, 'Pinching cones for positive isotropic curvature in dimensions seven and eight'] Let $n=7$ and $0<b\le\beta_7$. Then, with $\Lambda:=\frac{A}{2}\sqrt{35}$,
    \begin{equation}
        (1+b\sqrt5)^2<1+\Lambda,
    \end{equation}
