E_{\mu_{N,m}}\Big[ \sup_{t\in [0,T]} \Big| \int_0^t L_0F(s,\eta_s^N) ds\Big|^p \Big]
 & \le N^{-2p} C_p (N^2 T)^{(p-2)/2} \int_0^{N^2T} E^{\mu_{N,m}}\Big[ \{\Ga(F(N^{-2}u,\cdot))\}^{p/2} \Big] du\\
 & = N^{-2p} C_p (N^2 T)^{(p-2)/2} N^2 \int_0^T E^{\mu_{N,m}}\Big[ \{\Ga(F(t,\cdot))\}^{p/2} \Big] dt,
\end{align*}
which shows the first bound of the corollary.  The second follows from the first.
