Lemma \ref{lem:martingale}  implies $\p{Y_i<\frac{- m}{\log m}}<e^{-m^{1/10}}$, and Corollary \ref{cor:no-decrease-when-log}  and the definition of $X^*_j$ together imply  $\p{\exists 1 \le j \le i:X_j^*>X_j-X_{j-1}} \le m(","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:4be9ae37127831716b1689a462012899d2fc53c90d38b89c9ad1c9dd0b4dc799","revision_digest":"sha256:8290171c001399fc9276ea485f10652da0c145b535585277aa843e34a4eb3761","source_id":"arxiv:2604.25725","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

