[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2608.29585, '2608.29585'] For all integers $r,i$,
\begin{equation}
 X_r^{(n)}-X_i^{(n)}=\{r-i\}\{r+n+i\}.
\end{equation}
For $r,i\ge0$ and $n\ge2$, the nodes are pairwise distinct.

