[Lemma Holub-NA1-Lemma5 of arXiv:2609.00794, 'On operators whose adjoints or second adjoints attain their norms'] Let $X$ and $Y$ be Banach spaces. Then,
\begin{equation*}
    B_{\mathcal{F}(Y^*, X^*)} \subseteq \overline{B_{\mathcal{F}_{w^*, w^*}(Y^*, X^*)}}^{\tau_c}. 
