[Corollary 8 of arXiv:2608.09419, 'Left-tail expansions for Schr\"oder branching processes with explicit convergence rates'] \lb{C1}
 Under assumptions of Theorem \ref{T1}, suppose also that 
\[\lb{c001}
 1-\{re^{i\vp}:\ \vp\in(-\vp_0,\vp_0),\ r\in(0,r_0)\}\ss\mJ_P(0).
\]
Then $\Pi(z)$ can be analytically extended to the sector $S_{\vp_0}:=\{z:\ |\arg z|<\vp_0\}$. The image of this sector satisfies $\Pi(S_{\vp_0})\ss\mJ_P(0)\cup\{1\}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

