body:
[Theorem tflbppmf of arXiv:2411.09005, 'On Time-Changed Linear Birth-Death Process with Immigration at Extinction'] The state probabilities of TFLBPwI are 
	\begin{equation}
		\bar{p}^\nu(n,t)=\begin{cases}
			E_{\nu,1}(-t^\nu\alpha),\ n=0,\\
			\sum_{r=1}^{n}(-1)^r\binom{n-1}{r-1}\frac{\alpha}{r\lambda-\alpha}(E_{\nu,1}(-t^\nu r\lambda)-E_{\nu,1}(-t^\nu\alpha)),\ n\ge1,
		\end{cases}
	\end{equation}
	where $E_{\nu,1}(\cdot)$ is the Mittag-Leffler function defined as (see [Kilbas2006])
	\begin{equation}
		E_{\nu,1}(x)=\sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{x^k}{\Gamma(k\nu+1)},\ x\in\mathbb{R}.
	\end{equation}

