[Lem 131 of arXiv:2605.26664, 'Mixing times for Glauber dynamics of lozenge tilings of the hexagon'] For any $x \in [0,a]$, we have 
	\begin{flalign}

		f_0 ( \xi_x ) = \displaystyle\frac{\mathfrak{q}^{\xi_x - \gamma_x} - 1}{\mathfrak{q}^{x + \xi_x - \gamma_x} - 1}; \qquad f_0' (\xi_x) = \displaystyle\frac{\mathfrak{q}^{\xi_x - \gamma_x}}{(\mathfrak{q}^{x + \xi_x - \gamma_x} - 1)^2} \cdot (\mathfrak{q}^x - 1) \log \mathfrak{q}.
	\end{flalign}

