\begin{equation}
(\tilde{B}_1^n, \tilde{B}_2^n) \Rightarrow \mathbb{P}_{\mathrm{pin}}^{b, \vec{y}} \mbox{, and }(\tilde{B}_1^n, \tilde{B}_2^n) \Rightarrow (B_1, B_2),
\end{equation}
which by uniqueness of weak limits implies the statement of the lemma.

