    \exp\Big( - \tfrac{1}{\kappa}U(y) - W(x - y) \Big) \nu_0(y)^{ \frac{\kappa-1}{\kappa}}, \, \nabla W(x - y) \exp\Big( - \tfrac{1}{\kappa}U(y) - W(x - y) \Big) \nu_0(y)^{ \frac{\kappa-1}{\kappa}} \in ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:205e9fba33dd80db8b9421d071ed7f2f1d347d35ea75233a3565da8912218ce0","revision_digest":"sha256:a3a94b02cae3a85cbfcb2b0f50734e111b072353bf4cf80da25c667dbfdf424b","source_id":"arxiv:2412.07710","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

body:
[Lem uniform-in-beta-bounds-on-surface-tension-and-stiffness of arXiv:2605.08052, 'Rapid phase ordering of Ising dynamics on $\mathbb Z^2$'] There exists $\beta_0$ such that for all $\beta>\beta_0$, 
    \begin{enumerate}
        \item Scaling of the surface tension in $\beta$: For all $\theta\in [-\frac{\pi}{4}, \frac{\pi}{4}]$  one has 
        \begin{align*}
            \tau_{\beta}(\theta) \ge (1.9)\beta\,.
        \end{align*}
        \item Uniform positive stiffness: for all $\theta\in [-\frac{\pi}{4}, \frac{\pi}{4}]$, one has
        \begin{align*}
            \tau_\beta''(\theta) + \tau_\beta(\theta)> 1/3\,.
        \end{align*}
    \end{enumerate}

