        The set $\{r \in [0,\sigma(f^i)], f^i_r > H^i_r(s)\}$ is open, see Lemma \ref{lemma age process properties}, and so we can write it as $\bigcup_{j \in J_i} (a_j, b_j)$ for disjoint intervals $(a_j, b_j)$ of $[0,\sigma(f^i)]$ and some index set $J_i$. Note that 
