[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2604.05234, 'Quantitative propagation of chaos and universality for asymmetric Langevin spin glass dyna'] For all $\bfJ \in \R^{N\times N}$, the measure $P_t(\bfJ)$ satisfies the covariance bound 
    \begin{align*}
        \|\sfE_\bfJ[X_tX^\top_t]\|_{\textup{op}}\leq C_{\textup{Var}}\exp\Big(2t\beta N^{-1/2}\|\bfJ\|_{\textup{op}}\Big),
    \end{align*}
    where
    \begin{align*}
        C_{\textup{Var}}:=(C_\textup{P}(0)+T) e^{2tC_{\textup{Lip}}}.
    \end{align*}

