[Definition of arXiv:2412.06420, 'Accuracy, Estimates, and Representation Results'] $\mathsf{acc}$ is \emph{(strictly) proper}\index{(strictly) proper} iff for any $p\in[0,1]$, \begin{align}
	\mathrm{Exp}_p\mathsf{acc}(x)&:=p\mathsf{acc}_1(x)+(1-p)\mathsf{acc}_0(x)
	\end{align} obtains a (unique) maximum at $x=p$.

