[Corollary eq:theta-large of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[corollary]{cor:theta-large}
As \(\left\lvertu\right\rvert\to\infty\),
\begin{equation}
 \theta_p(u)=-\frac{u^2}{2}+\log(p\left\lvertu\right\rvert)
 +\frac12-\frac12\log p+O(u^{-2}).
\end{equation}
In particular, \(\theta_p(u)=-u^2/2+O(\log\left\lvertu\right\rvert)\).

